block, I settled my own and comrades bill using, however, my comrades money.

4
00:00:17,680 --> 00:00:21,919
The grinning landlord, as well as the borders, seemed amazingly tickled at the

5
00:00:21,920 --> 00:00:26,317
sudden friendship which had sprung up between me and Quiqu, especially as

6
00:00:26,318 --> 00:00:31,039
Peter Coffin's and bull stories about him had previously so much alarmed

7
00:00:31,040 --> 00:00:35,679
me concerning the very person whom I now accompanied with. We borrowed a

8
00:00:35,680 --> 00:00:40,078
wheelbarrow and embarking our things, including my own poor carpet bag and

9
00:00:40,079 --> 00:00:45,358
Quiquake's canvas sack and hammock, a way went down to the moss. A little

10
00:00:45,359 --> 00:00:50,238
Nantucket packet schooner mored at the wararf. As we were going along, the

11
00:00:50,239 --> 00:00:54,798
people stared, not at Quequake so much, for they were used to seeing cannibals

