23
00:01:49,280 --> 00:01:53,519
Shifting the barrerow from my hand to his, he told me a funny story about the

24
00:01:53,520 --> 00:01:58,558
first wheelbarrow he had ever seen. It was in Sag Harbor. The owners of his

