said, for those people have grace as well as we, though Quiquake told me that

43
00:03:22,559 --> 00:03:26,317
unlike us, who at such times look downward to our platters, they, on the

44
00:03:26,318 --> 00:03:31,679
contrary, copying the ducks, glance upward to the great giver of all feasts.

45
00:03:31,680 --> 00:03:35,999
Grace, I say, being said, the high priest opens the banquet by the

46
00:03:36,000 --> 00:03:40,718
immemorial ceremony of the island, that is, dipping his consecrated and

47
00:03:40,719 --> 00:03:45,839
consecrating fingers into the bowl before the blessed beverage circulates.

48
00:03:45,840 --> 00:03:50,477
seeing himself placed next to the priest and noting the ceremony and thinking

49
00:03:50,478 --> 00:03:54,958
himself being captain of a ship as having plain precedence over a mere

50
00:03:54,959 --> 00:04:00,078
