00:04:31,439 --> 00:04:36,718
upon her warves, and side by side the whirl wandering whale ships lay silent

58
00:04:36,719 --> 00:04:41,278
and safely mored at last, while from others came a sound of carpenters and

59
00:04:41,279 --> 00:04:46,878
coopers with blended noises of fires and forges to melt the pitch, all betoening

60
00:04:46,879 --> 00:04:52,317
that new cruises were on the start. that one most perilous and long voyage ended

61
00:04:52,318 --> 00:04:57,519
only begins a second and a second ended only begins a third and so on forever

62
00:04:57,520 --> 00:05:03,039
and for I such as the endlessness yay the intolerableness of all earthly

63
00:05:03,040 --> 00:05:08,397
effort gaining the more open water the bracing breeze waxed fresh the little

64
00:05:08,398 --> 00:05:13,358
moss tossed the quick foam from her boughs as a young cold his snortings how

