68
00:05:30,000 --> 00:05:35,039
At the same foam fountain, Quiquake seemed to drink and reel with me. His

69
00:05:35,040 --> 00:05:41,039
dusky nostrils swelled apart. He showed his filed and pointed teeth. On, on we

70
00:05:41,040 --> 00:05:45,839
flew, and our offing gained. The moss did homage to the blast. Ducked and

71
00:05:45,840 --> 00:05:51,199
dived her boughs as a slave before the sultan. Sideways leaning, we sideways

72
00:05:51,200 --> 00:05:56,878
darted. Every rope yarn tingling like a wire, the two tall mass buckling like

73
00:05:56,879 --> 00:05:59,999
Indian canes in land tornadoes.

74
00:06:00,000 --> 00:06:04,397
So full of this reeling scene were we, as we stood by the plunging bowsprit,

75
00:06:04,398 --> 00:06:08,958
that for some time we did not notice the jeering glances of the passengers, a

76
