into the air. Then slightly tapping his stern in Midsomerset, the fellow landed

84
00:06:48,159 --> 00:06:53,119
with bursting lungs upon his feet, while Quiquake, turning his back upon him,

85
00:06:53,120 --> 00:06:58,718
lighted his tomahawk pipe, and passed it to me for a puff. "Captain! Captain!"

86
00:06:58,719 --> 00:07:03,839
yelled the bumpkin, running towards that officer. "Captain! Captain, here's the

87
00:07:03,840 --> 00:07:09,999
devil." "Hello, you, sir," cried the captain, a gaunt rib of the sea,

88
00:07:10,000 --> 00:07:15,039
