94
00:07:39,040 --> 00:07:41,919
Quiquake. No killy so smally fishy.

95
00:07:41,920 --> 00:07:44,878
Quagilly big whale.

96
00:07:44,879 --> 00:07:50,158
Look you, roared the captain. I'll killy you, you cannibal, if you try any more

