All hands were in a panic, and to attempt snatching at the boom to stay it

103
00:08:18,318 --> 00:08:22,718
seemed madness. It flew from right to left and back again, almost in one

104
00:08:22,719 --> 00:08:26,958
ticking of a watch, and every instant seemed on the point of snapping into

105
