dropped deafly to his knees, and crawling under the path of the boom,

109
00:08:44,799 --> 00:08:48,878
whipped hold of a rope, secured one end to the bull works, and then, flinging

110
00:08:48,879 --> 00:08:53,519
the other like a lasso, caught it round the boom, as it swept over his head, and

111
00:08:53,520 --> 00:08:58,238
at the next jerk the spar was that way trapped, and all was safe. The schooner

112
00:08:58,239 --> 00:09:02,238
was run into the wind, and while the hands were clearing away the sternboat,

113
00:09:02,239 --> 00:09:07,199
Quiqu stripped to the waist, darted from the side with a long living arc of a

114
00:09:07,200 --> 00:09:12,397
leap. For 3 minutes or more he was seen swimming like a dog, throwing his long

115
