118
00:09:25,520 --> 00:09:30,158
perpendicularly from the water, Quiquake now took an instant glance around him,

119
00:09:30,159 --> 00:09:34,798
and seeming to see just how matters were, dived down and disappeared. A few

120
00:09:34,799 --> 00:09:39,199
minutes more and he rose again, one arm still striking out, and with the other

121
00:09:39,200 --> 00:09:44,238
dragging a lifeless form. The boat soon picked them up. The poor Bumpkin was

122
