127
00:10:07,760 --> 00:10:12,477
water, fresh water, something to wipe the brine off. That done, he put on dry

128
00:10:12,478 --> 00:10:16,878
clothes, lighted his pipe, and leaning against the bowl works, and mildly

129
00:10:16,879 --> 00:10:21,679
eyeing those around him, seemed to be saying to himself, "It's a mutual joint

